# tmp/ is the reproducibility basis (WAV material, third-party builds).
# It is referenced by path from the specification; it is not versioned.
tmp/

# refs/ holds third-party reference implementations -- the codec sources
# (QOA / adpcm-xq / SEA) and, for the instrument side, spessasynth_core. None of
# them are ours to vendor into this repository, and neither is the file that
# pins their URLs, commits and SHA-256.
refs/

# A stray .c/.h landing at the root -- a copy run from the wrong working
# directory -- was once committed by accident; these two lines make that
# inexpressible rather than merely unlikely.
/*.c
/*.h

# Not versioned, and never published: the internal notes and the session
# instructions. The repository carries the delivered tree and nothing else.
internal/
CLAUDE.md
